\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs20\alang1033 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl240\slmult1\sb0\sa60{\loch\fs22\b0\loch
If no matching metadata records are found, Research prints a zero-match result rather than treating that as an error. Missing TLOHome/logs, invalid TLOHome, or empty input are reported as errors. Ctrl-C stops the standalone app with cancellation status 130. }
